excerpts.text:
mpi_mapping:
  note: >-
    P01..P13 feed MPI-05/06/07/08 mechanical closure evidence at design-candidate authority.
    MPI-01 (load map), MPI-02 (protocol/EMC), MPI-03 (conductor map), MPI-04 (exact connector
    part numbers) are electrical/owner inputs NOT closed by this registry. Existing register
    files are not modified; this mapping is additive.
  by_mpi:
    MPI-01: {state: NOT_CLOSED_BY_THIS_REGISTRY, needed_from: owner_electrical_authority}
    MPI-02: {state: NOT_CLOSED_BY_THIS_REGISTRY, needed_from: owner_electrical_authority}
    MPI-03: {state: CANDIDATE_COMPONENTS_ONLY_UNCHANGED, fed_by: RFI shortlist component candidates}
    MPI-04: {state: FAMILY_CANDIDATES_ONLY_UNCHANGED, fed_by: RFI shortlist connector families}
    MPI-05: {state: FED_BY_DESIGN_CANDIDATE, fed_by: [P01, P03, P07, P09]}
    MPI-06: {state: FED_BY_DESIGN_CANDIDATE, fed_by: [P02, P06, P08, P11]}
    MPI-07: {state: FED_BY_DESIGN_CANDIDATE, fed_by: [P01, P02, P03, P04, P05, P07, P10, P11, P12, P13]}
    MPI-08: {state: FED_BY_DESIGN_ALLOCATION, fed_by: [P07], note: mission life allocation 1.0e4 cycles per joint is a design target, not a verified rating}
declared_downstream_holds:
  - quantified dynamic flex life and restoring-torque curves of the exact selected construction (supplier test; C5/C6)
  - exact connector/backshell part numbers, pin map, bonding (owner electrical authority; MPI-01..04)
  - e-chain, iglidur liner and sleeve space-environment (TVAC/outgassing/radiation) applicability evidence (C6)
